    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NeW YORK\n·25%\nBEl\nDELTA AIR LINES",
      "NEW YORK\n\"New York's finest,\" the big friendly policeman is an encyclopedia of\ninformation as well as law-man in the nation's largest city. His counsel\nCan aid a tour of museums, theatres, restaurants of all nations, night-\nclubs, world-famous shops and galleries, the United Nations. Delta's\nBig Jets serve New York's International Terminal from the South and\nSouthwest. Other Deltaliners serve convenient Newark Airport (only\n21 minutes from Manhattan) from the entire South. Call Delta or sec\nyour Travel Agent.\nDELTA-ONE OF AMERICA'S PIONEER SCHEDULED AIRLINES\nPOST CARD\n2015.166,2520"
    ],
